Usage: az issue <list|get|get-many|check|doctor|create|update|close|delete|dep|bulk-create|bulk-update|fanout> [arguments]

Commands:
  list [--project <project-id>] [--json] [--deps] [--limit N] [--id <id> ...] [--ids a,b,c]  List issues from daemon-backed store
  get [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [--deps] [<issue-id>]  Show a single issue by ID
  get-many [--project <project-id>] --id <issue-id> [--id <issue-id> ...] [--ids a,b,c] [--json]  Fetch many issues in requested order
  check [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [--deps] [<issue-id>]  Alias for get
  doctor [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [<issue-id>]  Run integrity checks for one issue
  create [--project <project-id>] <title> --impl <implementation> [--type ...] [--priority ...] [--description ...]  Create an issue
  update [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [<issue-id>] [--title ...] [--description ...] [--status ...] [--type ...] [--priority ...] [--update-impl <impl> ...]  Update issue fields
  close [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [<issue-id>]       Close an issue (sets status=closed)
  delete [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [<issue-id>] --confirm  Permanently delete an issue
  dep add [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--depends-on-id <depends-on-id>] [--type blocks|related|parent-child|discovered-from]  Add a dependency edge
  dep remove [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--depends-on-id <depends-on-id>] [--type blocks|related|parent-child|discovered-from] [--confirm]  Remove a dependency edge
  dep bulk apply [--project <project-id>] --input <path> [--dry-run] [--json]  Apply dependency edge mutations
  bulk-create [--project <project-id>] --impl <implementation> --input <path> [--dry-run]  Execute bulk create operations
  bulk-update [--project <project-id>] --impl <implementation> --input <path> [--dry-run]  Execute bulk update operations
  fanout [--project <project-id>] --input <path> [--apply] [--json]  Plan/apply nested issue fanout
  fanout ready [--project <project-id>] --root <issue-id> [--json]  List runnable leaf issues under a fanout root
  fanout drift [--project <project-id>] --issue <issue-id> [--worktree <path>] [--json] [--fail-on-out]  Advisory ownership drift diagnostics

Argument ordering: place flags/options before positional arguments for deterministic parsing.
